Z||000022||AL||07-27-2001||07:34 PM||||if i was you i would buy a simple book that shows you the chords,practice those chords until your hand knows where to put and play every chord,now if you really want to play, then take lessons,your teacher will show you how to read music, <BR>that way you won't be like everyone else who only knows how to play three cords or by someone showing you how to play a song you want to learn,i've been playing for more then 25 yrs,but if you just want to play for kicks then learn the chords.<BR><B>AL</B> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/AL_sig.gif"> <BR>3 acoustic guitars<BR>1 1976 les paul custom <BR>1 1979 les paul standard <BR>1 84 fender strat<P>------------------<BR> ||||reg||1
